<title>FRANCE: France reports bids for free-mkt wheat, barley.</title>
<headline>France reports bids for free-mkt wheat, barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market wheat at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Oct 10 ---		 --- Oct 3 ---</p>
<p>MAIN TENDER</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  591,250    5.74-13.00	692,050    4.37-11.37</p>
<p> Barley	353,000   30.87-36.37	359,300   28.80-36.65</p>
<p> Rye	    17,000   Not given	   10,000   Not given</p>
<p>ACP TENDER</p>
<p> Soft wheat  No bids reported		 7,500   Not given</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
